/* MINI STORIES — part 5: Chapters 5–7 */
Object.assign(STORY_MORE,{"ng1":{"field":"Battery Purchasing","hero":"Mahmoud","icon":"🔋","title":"Two thousand batteries","ar":"ألفين بطارية","scene":"Mahmoud buys batteries for the company's UPS projects. Today he negotiates a big order with a supplier's agent — and time is short.","words":["We are looking for a more competitive offer","We cannot lower our price any further","We have other options available to us","Can you offer any other incentives or adjustments","We could also provide a 90-day payment term to help with cash flow","the delivery timeline is a critical aspect of this agreement","That sounds like a reasonable offer"],"tech":[["purchase order (PO)","أمر شراء"],["VRLA battery","بطارية ‎VRLA‎ (رصاص مقفولة)"],["unit price","سعر الوحدة"],["payment term","مدة السداد"],["cash flow","السيولة"],["delivery timeline","الجدول الزمني للتوريد"]],"lines":["Mahmoud is the purchasing manager at PowerLink, a company in Nasr City that sells UPS systems and batteries.","This month they won a big project: UPS systems for twelve bank branches. They need two thousand 12-volt VRLA batteries.","Mr. Wael, the agent of a battery factory, came to his office with a price list.","Mahmoud looked at the unit price and shook his head. \"We are looking for a more competitive offer, Mr. Wael.\"","\"I'm sorry, Mahmoud. We cannot lower our price any further. The price of lead went up this year.\"","\"I understand. But we have other options available to us. Two other suppliers sent us quotations last week.\"","Wael was quiet for a moment. Mahmoud continued, \"Can you offer any other incentives or adjustments?\"","\"The price stays the same,\" Wael said. \"But we could also provide a 90-day payment term to help with cash flow.\"","That was interesting. PowerLink usually pays in thirty days, and the bank pays them late.","\"One more thing. The delivery timeline is a critical aspect of this agreement. We need the batteries in our warehouse in six weeks.\"","Wael called the factory in 10th of Ramadan. \"Five weeks, and we deliver to your warehouse for free.\"","Mahmoud smiled. \"That sounds like a reasonable offer.\"","That afternoon, he sent the purchase order — and the batteries arrived one day early."],"qa":[{"q":"Where does Mahmoud work?","a":"At PowerLink, a UPS and battery company in Nasr City.","opts":["At PowerLink","At a bank"],"k":0},{"q":"What project did they win?","a":"UPS systems for twelve bank branches.","opts":["Two hospitals","Twelve bank branches"],"k":1},{"q":"How many batteries do they need?","a":"Two thousand 12-volt VRLA batteries.","opts":["Two hundred","Two thousand"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Mahmoud say about the price?","a":"\"We are looking for a more competitive offer.\"","opts":["A higher price","A more competitive offer"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Wael answer?","a":"\"We cannot lower our price any further.\"","opts":["We can lower it a lot","We cannot lower our price any further"],"k":1},{"q":"Why did the price not go down?","a":"The price of lead went up this year.","opts":["The dollar went down","The price of lead went up"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Mahmoud say about other suppliers?","a":"\"We have other options available to us.\"","opts":["We have no options","We have other options available to us"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he ask for next?","a":"\"Can you offer any other incentives or adjustments?\"","opts":["A free car","Other incentives or adjustments"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Wael offer?","a":"\"We could also provide a 90-day payment term to help with cash flow.\"","opts":["A 90-day payment term","A 90% discount"],"k":0},{"q":"Why was that interesting for PowerLink?","a":"They usually pay in thirty days, and the bank pays them late.","opts":["They have too much cash","The bank pays them late"],"k":1},{"q":"What is critical for Mahmoud?","a":"\"The delivery timeline is a critical aspect of this agreement.\"","opts":["The colour of the batteries","The delivery timeline"],"k":1},{"q":"What was Wael's final offer?","a":"Five weeks, with free delivery to the warehouse.","opts":["Ten weeks, paid delivery","Five weeks, free delivery"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Mahmoud answer?","a":"\"That sounds like a reasonable offer.\"","opts":["That sounds like a reasonable offer","That's too expensive"],"k":0},{"q":"When did the batteries arrive?","a":"One day early.","opts":["One week late","One day early"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Mahmoud negotiating with the battery supplier: \"We are looking for a more competitive offer… We cannot lower our price any further… We have other options available to us… Can you offer any other incentives or adjustments… We could also provide a 90-day payment term to help with cash flow… the delivery timeline is a critical aspect of this agreement… That sounds like a reasonable offer.\""},"ng2":{"field":"Maintenance Contracts","hero":"Nour","icon":"🤝","title":"Meeting in the middle","ar":"نتقابل في النص","scene":"Nour has to renew a UPS maintenance contract with a big hospital. The hospital wants a lower price.","words":["I wanted to touch base with you about","Let's establish some ground rules before we begin","Can we outline the key terms and conditions of our agreement","Our bottom line is","Is there any flexibility on your end","Can we find a way to meet in the middle on this issue","Let's work towards a mutually beneficial agreement"],"tech":[["contract renewal","تجديد العقد"],["preventive visit","زيارة صيانة وقائية"],["response time","زمن الاستجابة"],["spare parts","قطع الغيار"],["annual fee","القيمة السنوية"],["on call","متاح للطوارئ"]],"lines":["Nour is an account manager at PowerLink. Her biggest client is Al-Salam Hospital in Alexandria.","Their UPS maintenance contract ends next month, so she called Eng. Magdy, the hospital's technical manager.","\"Good morning, Eng. Magdy. I wanted to touch base with you about the contract renewal.\"","They met the next day in his office. \"Let's establish some ground rules before we begin,\" Magdy said. \"One hour, and no surprises.\"","\"Perfect,\" Nour said. \"Can we outline the key terms and conditions of our agreement first?\"","They wrote them on the board: four preventive visits a year, an engineer on call 24/7, and a response time of four hours.","Then Magdy spoke about money. \"The hospital budget is smaller this year. We want to pay 15% less.\"","Nour did not panic. \"Our bottom line is the same service quality. We can't send fewer engineers to a hospital.\"","\"I understand,\" Magdy said. \"But is there any flexibility on your end?\"","Nour thought for a moment. \"Can we find a way to meet in the middle on this issue? We can do 7% less if you sign for two years.\"","\"And the spare parts?\" \"Fans and fuses are included. Batteries are quoted separately.\"","\"Let's work towards a mutually beneficial agreement,\" Nour added. \"You save money, and we keep a good client.\"","Magdy laughed and shook her hand. \"Send me the new contract today.\""],"qa":[{"q":"Who is Nour's biggest client?","a":"Al-Salam Hospital in Alexandria.","opts":["A school in Cairo","Al-Salam Hospital"],"k":1},{"q":"Why did she call Eng. Magdy?","a":"\"I wanted to touch base with you about the contract renewal.\"","opts":["About a new job","About the contract renewal"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Magdy want before they began?","a":"\"Let's establish some ground rules before we begin.\"","opts":["Some ground rules","A long lunch"],"k":0},{"q":"What were his rules?","a":"One hour, and no surprises.","opts":["Three hours, many surprises","One hour, no surprises"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Nour ask to do first?","a":"\"Can we outline the key terms and conditions of our agreement?\"","opts":["Talk about football","Outline the key terms and conditions"],"k":1},{"q":"How many preventive visits a year?","a":"Four.","opts":["Fourteen","Four"],"k":1},{"q":"What did the hospital want?","a":"To pay 15% less.","opts":["To pay 15% more","To pay 15% less"],"k":1},{"q":"What is Nour's bottom line?","a":"\"Our bottom line is the same service quality.\"","opts":["Fewer engineers","The same service quality"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Magdy ask?","a":"\"Is there any flexibility on your end?\"","opts":["Any flexibility on your end?","Any coffee?"],"k":0},{"q":"How did Nour try to meet in the middle?","a":"7% less if they sign for two years.","opts":["15% less for one year","7% less for two years"],"k":1},{"q":"Are batteries included?","a":"No, they are quoted separately.","opts":["Yes","No, quoted separately"],"k":1},{"q":"What kind of agreement does Nour want?","a":"\"A mutually beneficial agreement.\"","opts":["A one-sided agreement","A mutually beneficial agreement"],"k":1},{"q":"How did the meeting end?","a":"Magdy asked her to send the new contract today.","opts":["He cancelled the contract","He asked for the new contract"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Nour renewing the hospital contract: \"I wanted to touch base with you about… Let's establish some ground rules before we begin… Can we outline the key terms and conditions of our agreement… Our bottom line is… Is there any flexibility on your end… Can we find a way to meet in the middle on this issue… Let's work towards a mutually beneficial agreement.\""},"ng3":{"field":"Solar Stations for Farms","hero":"Karim","icon":"☀️","title":"Sunshine in Sadat City","ar":"شمس مدينة السادات","scene":"Karim wants to build a solar station for a big farm. The farm owner is interested, but he has his own ideas about the price.","words":["Just to clarify, are you saying","How about if we offer you","we're open to negotiating if you have any counteroffers","we're prepared to sweeten the deal","I cannot stress enough the importance of","Based on our experience, we think that this approach would be the most beneficial","Your proposal is definitely worth considering"],"tech":[["solar station","محطة طاقة شمسية"],["irrigation pump","طلمبة ري"],["solar pump inverter","إنفرتر طلمبات شمسي"],["down payment","دفعة مقدمة"],["panel cleaning","تنضيف الألواح"],["EPC contract","عقد تصميم وتوريد وتركيب"]],"lines":["Karim is a solar sales engineer at PowerLink. His client, Hajj Fathy, owns a big orange farm near Sadat City.","The farm has ten irrigation pumps, and the diesel bill is killing him.","Karim offered a 400 kW solar station with solar pump inverters for 9 million pounds.","Hajj Fathy said, \"I will pay half now, and the rest after one year of good results.\"","\"Just to clarify, are you saying you want to pay 50% after one year?\" Karim asked.","\"Exactly. If the pumps work well, you get your money.\"","Karim thought about the company's cash flow. \"How about if we offer you a longer warranty in exchange for 70% before installation?\"","\"That's our offer, but we're open to negotiating if you have any counteroffers.\"","Hajj Fathy asked for 60%. Karim called his manager, then came back. \"For 60%, we're prepared to sweeten the deal with free panel cleaning for the first year.\"","\"And one more thing. I cannot stress enough the importance of maintenance. Dusty panels can lose 20% of their power.\"","\"Based on our experience, we think that this approach would be the most beneficial: we clean and check the station every month.\"","Hajj Fathy drank his tea slowly. \"Your proposal is definitely worth considering. Let me talk to my sons.\"","Two days later, he called Karim. \"Come to the farm on Saturday — and bring the contract.\""],"qa":[{"q":"What does Hajj Fathy own?","a":"A big orange farm near Sadat City.","opts":["An orange farm","A hotel"],"k":0},{"q":"What is killing him?","a":"The diesel bill for ten irrigation pumps.","opts":["The water bill","The diesel bill"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Karim offer?","a":"A 400 kW solar station for 9 million pounds.","opts":["A 400 kW solar station","A diesel generator"],"k":0},{"q":"How did Hajj Fathy want to pay?","a":"Half now, and the rest after one year.","opts":["All now","Half now, half after a year"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Karim check?","a":"\"Just to clarify, are you saying you want to pay 50% after one year?\"","opts":["Just to clarify, are you saying…","Are you crazy?"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Karim offer in exchange for 70%?","a":"\"How about if we offer you a longer warranty?\"","opts":["A free car","A longer warranty"],"k":1},{"q":"Is Karim open to other ideas?","a":"Yes. \"We're open to negotiating if you have any counteroffers.\"","opts":["No","Yes, he's open to counteroffers"],"k":1},{"q":"How much did Hajj Fathy offer to pay first?","a":"60%.","opts":["30%","60%"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Karim sweeten the deal?","a":"Free panel cleaning for the first year.","opts":["Free panel cleaning","A lower price"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he stress?","a":"\"I cannot stress enough the importance of maintenance.\"","opts":["The importance of tea","The importance of maintenance"],"k":1},{"q":"How much power can dusty panels lose?","a":"20%.","opts":["2%","20%"],"k":1},{"q":"What approach does Karim recommend?","a":"Clean and check the station every month.","opts":["Once a year","Every month"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Hajj Fathy say about the proposal?","a":"\"Your proposal is definitely worth considering.\"","opts":["It's worth considering","It's a bad idea"],"k":0},{"q":"What happened two days later?","a":"He asked Karim to come on Saturday with the contract.","opts":["He said no","He asked for the contract"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Karim with Hajj Fathy on the farm: \"Just to clarify, are you saying… How about if we offer you… we're open to negotiating if you have any counteroffers… we're prepared to sweeten the deal… I cannot stress enough the importance of… Based on our experience, we think that this approach would be the most beneficial… Your proposal is definitely worth considering.\""},"ng4":{"field":"VFD Import","hero":"Dina","icon":"💧","title":"Loose ends","ar":"حاجات لسه مش متقفلة","scene":"Dina imports VFDs for water stations. A foreign supplier sends a good offer, but some details are not good enough yet.","words":["there are still a couple of loose ends to tie up","That being said, there are a few areas where we'd like to negotiate","I'm afraid we can't accept this offer as it stands","Let me take a closer look at this and get back to you","I need to discuss this with my team before making a decision","I'm willing to make some concessions in other areas","Can you give me some more details about how you arrived at that price"],"tech":[["VFD (variable frequency drive)","مغيّر سرعة (إنفرتر)"],["water station","محطة مياه"],["shipping cost","تكلفة الشحن"],["customs clearance","التخليص الجمركي"],["warranty","ضمان"],["lead time","مدة التوريد"]],"lines":["Dina works in import at PowerLink's office in 6th of October City. She buys VFDs for pumps in water stations.","A supplier from Europe sent an offer for sixty 75 kW drives. She had a video call with their sales manager, Mr. Paolo.","\"The offer is good,\" Dina said, \"but there are still a couple of loose ends to tie up.\"","\"We like your quality and your warranty. That being said, there are a few areas where we'd like to negotiate.\"","\"First, the lead time is sixteen weeks. The water company needs the drives before summer. I'm afraid we can't accept this offer as it stands.\"","Paolo said, \"We can make it twelve weeks, but the price will go up by 4%.\"","Dina did not answer quickly. \"Let me take a closer look at this and get back to you.\"","She also asked about the shipping cost. \"Can you give me some more details about how you arrived at that price?\"","Paolo explained that he used air freight for part of the order. Dina said sea freight to Alexandria was enough.","\"I need to discuss this with my team before making a decision,\" she said at the end of the call.","The next day she called him back. \"I'm willing to make some concessions in other areas. We can pay 30% in advance instead of 10%.\"","\"Then twelve weeks, sea freight, and the same price,\" Paolo said.","Dina closed her laptop and told her manager, \"The drives will be here before summer.\""],"qa":[{"q":"What does Dina buy?","a":"VFDs for pumps in water stations.","opts":["VFDs for pumps","Office chairs"],"k":0},{"q":"How many drives were in the offer?","a":"Sixty 75 kW drives.","opts":["Sixteen","Sixty"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she say about the offer?","a":"\"There are still a couple of loose ends to tie up.\"","opts":["It's perfect","There are loose ends to tie up"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she like?","a":"Their quality and their warranty.","opts":["Their long lead time","Their quality and warranty"],"k":1},{"q":"What came after the praise?","a":"\"That being said, there are a few areas where we'd like to negotiate.\"","opts":["A few areas to negotiate","Nothing else"],"k":0},{"q":"What was the first problem?","a":"The lead time was sixteen weeks.","opts":["The colour","The lead time"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she say about the offer as it stands?","a":"\"I'm afraid we can't accept this offer as it stands.\"","opts":["We accept it now","We can't accept it as it stands"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Paolo say about twelve weeks?","a":"The price would go up by 4%.","opts":["Price down 4%","Price up 4%"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Dina buy time?","a":"\"Let me take a closer look at this and get back to you.\"","opts":["Let me take a closer look","Let me sign now"],"k":0},{"q":"What did she ask about the shipping cost?","a":"\"Can you give me some more details about how you arrived at that price?\"","opts":["Why he is late","How he arrived at the price"],"k":1},{"q":"What freight did Dina want?","a":"Sea freight to Alexandria.","opts":["Air freight","Sea freight"],"k":1},{"q":"Who does she need to talk to?","a":"\"I need to discuss this with my team before making a decision.\"","opts":["Her mother","Her team"],"k":1},{"q":"What concession did she make?","a":"30% in advance instead of 10%.","opts":["30% in advance","A longer lead time"],"k":0},{"q":"What was the final deal?","a":"Twelve weeks, sea freight, and the same price.","opts":["Sixteen weeks, higher price","Twelve weeks, same price"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Dina on the call with the supplier: \"there are still a couple of loose ends to tie up… That being said, there are a few areas where we'd like to negotiate… I'm afraid we can't accept this offer as it stands… Let me take a closer look at this and get back to you… I need to discuss this with my team before making a decision… I'm willing to make some concessions in other areas… Can you give me some more details about how you arrived at that price.\""},"ng5":{"field":"Servers & IT","hero":"Hany","icon":"🖥️","title":"The bigger picture","ar":"الصورة الأكبر","scene":"Hany sells servers to a university. The university's IT manager has cheaper offers and wants a discount.","words":["Is there any way you could match or beat those offers","Is there any way we could negotiate a bulk discount","can we get to the heart of the matter","I want to make sure we're both on the same page","Let's take a step back and review what we've covered so far","let's consider the bigger picture","We have a track record of successful partnerships with"],"tech":[["rack server","سيرفر راك"],["storage","وحدة تخزين"],["bulk discount","خصم على الكمية"],["installation","تركيب"],["support contract","عقد دعم فني"],["quotation","عرض سعر"]],"lines":["Hany is an IT sales engineer at PowerLink. He is meeting Dr. Ashraf, the IT manager of a private university in Mansoura.","The university wants twenty rack servers and new storage for its data centre.","Dr. Ashraf put three quotations on the table. \"Your price is the highest. Is there any way you could match or beat those offers?\"","Hany looked at the other offers. They did not include installation or support.","\"And we may need forty servers next year,\" Dr. Ashraf added. \"Is there any way we could negotiate a bulk discount?\"","They talked for thirty minutes about models, cables and delivery. Hany finally said, \"Dr. Ashraf, can we get to the heart of the matter?\"","\"I want to make sure we're both on the same page. Is price your only concern, or also support after installation?\"","\"Both,\" Dr. Ashraf admitted. \"Last year our servers were down for three days, and nobody came.\"","\"Let's take a step back and review what we've covered so far: twenty servers now, maybe forty next year, and fast support.\"","\"Now let's consider the bigger picture. The other offers are cheaper, but you will pay later for every visit.\"","\"We have a track record of successful partnerships with three universities in the Delta. You can call their IT managers.\"","Hany offered a 5% discount now and 10% on next year's order, with support included.","Dr. Ashraf called one of the universities that evening. The next morning, Hany received the PO."],"qa":[{"q":"Who is Dr. Ashraf?","a":"The IT manager of a private university in Mansoura.","opts":["A doctor in a hospital","The university IT manager"],"k":1},{"q":"What does the university want?","a":"Twenty rack servers and new storage.","opts":["Two laptops","Twenty servers and storage"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Dr. Ashraf ask about the other offers?","a":"\"Is there any way you could match or beat those offers?\"","opts":["Match or beat those offers","Raise your price"],"k":0},{"q":"What was missing in the other offers?","a":"Installation and support.","opts":["Servers","Installation and support"],"k":1},{"q":"Why did he ask for a bulk discount?","a":"They may need forty servers next year.","opts":["They may need forty more","They have no budget"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Hany say after thirty minutes?","a":"\"Can we get to the heart of the matter?\"","opts":["Can we have lunch?","Can we get to the heart of the matter?"],"k":1},{"q":"Why did Hany ask about price and support?","a":"\"I want to make sure we're both on the same page.\"","opts":["To be on the same page","To end the meeting"],"k":0},{"q":"What happened last year?","a":"Their servers were down for three days, and nobody came.","opts":["Nothing","Servers were down for three days"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Hany summarise?","a":"\"Let's take a step back and review what we've covered so far.\"","opts":["Let's take a step back and review","Let's go home"],"k":0},{"q":"What is the bigger picture?","a":"Cheaper offers mean paying later for every visit.","opts":["Cheap is always better","Cheaper now, more expensive later"],"k":1},{"q":"What track record does PowerLink have?","a":"Successful partnerships with three universities in the Delta.","opts":["Three universities","Three hotels"],"k":0},{"q":"What discount did Hany offer?","a":"5% now and 10% on next year's order.","opts":["50% now","5% now, 10% next year"],"k":1},{"q":"What happened the next morning?","a":"Hany received the PO.","opts":["He lost the deal","He received the PO"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Hany with the university IT manager: \"Is there any way you could match or beat those offers… Is there any way we could negotiate a bulk discount… can we get to the heart of the matter… I want to make sure we're both on the same page… Let's take a step back and review what we've covered so far… let's consider the bigger picture… We have a track record of successful partnerships with.\""},"dg1":{"field":"Chillers & HVAC Drives","hero":"Salma","icon":"💻","title":"The frozen screen","ar":"الشاشة اللي هنجت","scene":"Salma is leading a Teams call about a broken chiller drive in a hospital, but her internet has other plans.","words":["I'm experiencing some connectivity issues","Please bear with me","Let me quickly troubleshoot and get back to you","Apologies for the sudden disconnection","Kindly mute your microphone when you're not speaking","Please feel free to use the chat function to ask any questions","let's allow the current speaker to finish their point first"],"tech":[["chiller","تشيلر (وحدة تبريد مركزية)"],["drive fault","عطل في الإنفرتر"],["overvoltage","زيادة في الجهد"],["fault code","كود العطل"],["screen sharing","مشاركة الشاشة"],["site engineer","مهندس الموقع"]],"lines":["Salma is a service engineer at PowerLink. She works from home on Thursdays in Nasr City.","At ten o'clock, she started a Teams call with a hospital in Alexandria. One of their chiller VFDs had stopped with a fault.","Six people joined: the hospital's engineers, a technician on site, and her manager.","After two minutes, her video froze. \"I'm experiencing some connectivity issues. Please bear with me.\"","Then her microphone stopped working. She typed: \"Let me quickly troubleshoot and get back to you.\"","She moved closer to the router and joined again. \"Apologies for the sudden disconnection. I'm back now.\"","There was a loud noise on the call — someone was in a noisy workshop.","\"Kindly mute your microphone when you're not speaking,\" Salma said politely. The noise stopped.","The technician, Ibrahim, shared a photo of the drive screen. The fault code said \"overvoltage\".","\"Please feel free to use the chat function to ask any questions,\" Salma said, \"so we don't talk at the same time.\"","Two engineers started talking together. \"Sorry — let's allow the current speaker to finish their point first,\" she said.","Ibrahim finished: the fault started after a power cut last night. Salma asked him to change one setting in the drive.","Five minutes later, the chiller was running again — and Salma's internet was still working."],"qa":[{"q":"Where does Salma work on Thursdays?","a":"From home in Nasr City.","opts":["From home","At the hospital"],"k":0},{"q":"What was the problem at the hospital?","a":"A chiller VFD stopped with a fault.","opts":["A broken door","A chiller VFD fault"],"k":1},{"q":"What happened after two minutes?","a":"Her video froze. \"I'm experiencing some connectivity issues.\"","opts":["Her video froze","The power went off"],"k":0},{"q":"What did she ask the others?","a":"\"Please bear with me.\"","opts":["Please leave","Please bear with me"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she type when her microphone stopped?","a":"\"Let me quickly troubleshoot and get back to you.\"","opts":["Let me quickly troubleshoot","Goodbye"],"k":0},{"q":"What did she say when she came back?","a":"\"Apologies for the sudden disconnection.\"","opts":["Who are you?","Apologies for the sudden disconnection"],"k":1},{"q":"Where did the loud noise come from?","a":"Someone in a noisy workshop.","opts":["A noisy workshop","A football match"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Salma ask?","a":"\"Kindly mute your microphone when you're not speaking.\"","opts":["Turn on your camera","Mute your microphone"],"k":1},{"q":"What did the fault code say?","a":"Overvoltage.","opts":["Overheating","Overvoltage"],"k":1},{"q":"Where can people ask questions?","a":"\"Please feel free to use the chat function to ask any questions.\"","opts":["By email only","In the chat"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she say when two engineers talked together?","a":"\"Let's allow the current speaker to finish their point first.\"","opts":["Let the speaker finish","Everyone talk now"],"k":0},{"q":"When did the fault start?","a":"After a power cut last night.","opts":["This morning","After a power cut"],"k":1},{"q":"What happened five minutes later?","a":"The chiller was running again.","opts":["The chiller broke","The chiller was running again"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Salma on the Teams call: \"I'm experiencing some connectivity issues… Please bear with me… Let me quickly troubleshoot and get back to you… Apologies for the sudden disconnection… Kindly mute your microphone when you're not speaking… Please feel free to use the chat function to ask any questions… let's allow the current speaker to finish their point first.\""},"dg2":{"field":"Projects & Collections","hero":"Mostafa","icon":"📱","title":"A friendly reminder","ar":"تذكير لطيف","scene":"Mostafa runs a Zoom meeting about a data centre project, then sends a few important WhatsApp messages to the client.","words":["Could you please give me a quick recap","In the interest of time","By continuing in this meeting, you consent to being recorded","I wanted to touch base regarding","we've encountered an unexpected issue with","we're on track to meet the deadline","Just a friendly reminder that invoice"],"tech":[["project coordinator","منسق المشروع"],["server room","أوضة السيرفرات"],["precision cooling","تكييف دقيق"],["e-invoice","فاتورة إلكترونية"],["deadline","الميعاد النهائي"],["follow-up","متابعة"]],"lines":["Mostafa is a project coordinator at PowerLink. His team is building a server room for a pharmaceutical company in Sadat City.","Every Monday there is a Zoom meeting with the client. Today he started it on time.","\"Good morning, everyone. We're recording today. By continuing in this meeting, you consent to being recorded.\"","After ten minutes, the client's IT manager, Mrs. Hala, joined late. \"Sorry, I was in the factory. Could you please give me a quick recap?\"","Mostafa summarised: the UPS was installed, the racks were ready, and the precision cooling was coming next week.","Everybody started talking about cable colours. \"In the interest of time, let's discuss cables by email,\" Mostafa said.","After the meeting, he sent Mrs. Hala a WhatsApp message.","\"Hello Mrs. Hala, I wanted to touch base regarding the cooling units.\"","\"Unfortunately, we've encountered an unexpected issue with the shipment. It is two days late at the port.\"","\"But don't worry. The team will work on Friday, so we're on track to meet the deadline on the 30th.\"","An hour later, he sent another message: \"Just a friendly reminder that invoice No. 2245 was due last week. The e-invoice is attached.\"","Mrs. Hala replied with a thumbs up. \"Thanks, Mostafa. Finance will transfer the payment tomorrow.\"","Mostafa smiled. A good project is on time — and paid on time."],"qa":[{"q":"What is Mostafa's team building?","a":"A server room for a pharmaceutical company.","opts":["A server room","A school"],"k":0},{"q":"When is the meeting with the client?","a":"Every Monday on Zoom.","opts":["Every Friday","Every Monday"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he say about the recording?","a":"\"By continuing in this meeting, you consent to being recorded.\"","opts":["You consent to being recorded","No recording today"],"k":0},{"q":"Why was Mrs. Hala late?","a":"She was in the factory.","opts":["She was sleeping","She was in the factory"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she ask for?","a":"\"Could you please give me a quick recap?\"","opts":["A long report","A quick recap"],"k":1},{"q":"What is coming next week?","a":"The precision cooling.","opts":["The UPS","The precision cooling"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Mostafa say about the cable discussion?","a":"\"In the interest of time, let's discuss cables by email.\"","opts":["Discuss it by email","Discuss it for an hour"],"k":0},{"q":"How did he start his WhatsApp message?","a":"\"I wanted to touch base regarding the cooling units.\"","opts":["Call me now","Touch base regarding the cooling units"],"k":1},{"q":"What was the unexpected issue?","a":"The shipment was two days late at the port.","opts":["The shipment was late","The client cancelled"],"k":0},{"q":"Will they meet the deadline?","a":"Yes. \"We're on track to meet the deadline on the 30th.\"","opts":["No","Yes, they're on track"],"k":1},{"q":"What was his second message about?","a":"\"Just a friendly reminder that invoice No. 2245 was due last week.\"","opts":["A late invoice","A birthday party"],"k":0},{"q":"When will finance pay?","a":"Tomorrow.","opts":["Next month","Tomorrow"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Mostafa in the Zoom meeting and on WhatsApp: \"Could you please give me a quick recap… In the interest of time… By continuing in this meeting, you consent to being recorded… I wanted to touch base regarding… we've encountered an unexpected issue with… we're on track to meet the deadline… Just a friendly reminder that invoice.\""},"dg3":{"field":"Data Centre Engineering","hero":"Yasmine","icon":"💼","title":"Ten years in three lines","ar":"عشر سنين في تلات سطور","scene":"Yasmine is an experienced data centre engineer, but her LinkedIn profile is almost empty. Her friend helps her write a bio.","words":["Results-driven professional with","Proven track record of success in","Adept at solving complex problems","A collaborative team player","seeking to leverage extensive experience in","Committed to lifelong learning","I have a proven track record of driving growth"],"tech":[["data centre","داتا سنتر (مركز بيانات)"],["uptime","مدة التشغيل من غير توقف"],["certification","شهادة معتمدة"],["headline","العنوان تحت الاسم"],["profile","البروفايل"],["recruiter","مسؤول توظيف"]],"lines":["Yasmine has worked at PowerLink for ten years. She designs power and cooling for data centres.","But her LinkedIn profile had only her name and an old photo from university.","Her friend Reem, who works in HR, said, \"Recruiters can't see how good you are. Let's write your bio together.\"","They sat in a café in Zamalek with two coffees and a laptop.","Reem typed the first line: \"Results-driven professional with ten years of experience in data centre power and cooling.\"","\"Now your projects,\" Reem said. Yasmine wrote: \"Proven track record of success in delivering data centres for banks and hospitals.\"","\"What about the night the bank's UPS failed?\" Reem asked. So Yasmine added: \"Adept at solving complex problems under pressure.\"","\"And you always help the new engineers.\" Yasmine wrote: \"A collaborative team player who enjoys training young engineers.\"","Then the future: \"Seeking to leverage extensive experience in critical power to build greener data centres in Egypt.\"","Yasmine had three new certifications, so she added: \"Committed to lifelong learning.\"","For the About section, she wrote about her sales work: \"I have a proven track record of driving growth — our data centre sales doubled in three years.\"","She changed her old photo and clicked \"Save\".","One week later, she had forty new connections and an invitation to speak at a conference in Cairo."],"qa":[{"q":"How long has Yasmine worked at PowerLink?","a":"Ten years.","opts":["Ten years","Two years"],"k":0},{"q":"What was wrong with her LinkedIn profile?","a":"It had only her name and an old photo.","opts":["It was too long","It was almost empty"],"k":1},{"q":"Who helped her?","a":"Her friend Reem from HR.","opts":["Her manager","Her friend Reem"],"k":1},{"q":"How did the first line start?","a":"\"Results-driven professional with ten years of experience…\"","opts":["Lazy engineer with…","Results-driven professional with…"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she write about her projects?","a":"\"Proven track record of success in delivering data centres.\"","opts":["Proven track record of success","No experience"],"k":0},{"q":"Which story showed her problem-solving?","a":"The night the bank's UPS failed.","opts":["Her wedding day","The night the UPS failed"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she write about problems?","a":"\"Adept at solving complex problems under pressure.\"","opts":["Adept at solving complex problems","Afraid of problems"],"k":0},{"q":"Why did she write she's a team player?","a":"She always helps the new engineers.","opts":["She works alone","She helps new engineers"],"k":1},{"q":"What does she want to build?","a":"Greener data centres in Egypt, leveraging her extensive experience.","opts":["Greener data centres","Bigger offices"],"k":0},{"q":"Why did she write \"Committed to lifelong learning\"?","a":"She had three new certifications.","opts":["She stopped studying","She has new certifications"],"k":1},{"q":"What growth did she mention?","a":"Data centre sales doubled in three years.","opts":["Sales doubled","Sales fell"],"k":0},{"q":"What happened one week later?","a":"Forty new connections and an invitation to a conference.","opts":["Nothing","Forty connections and an invitation"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Yasmine writing her LinkedIn bio: \"Results-driven professional with… Proven track record of success in… Adept at solving complex problems… A collaborative team player… seeking to leverage extensive experience in… Committed to lifelong learning… I have a proven track record of driving growth.\""},"dg4":{"field":"Control Cards","hero":"Ahmed","icon":"🌐","title":"One message at a time","ar":"رسالة ورا رسالة","scene":"Ahmed is a young engineer who repairs control cards. He starts using LinkedIn to build his network.","words":["I came across your profile and was impressed by your background in","Thanks for shedding light on this topic","Your hard work has paid off","would be willing to write me a recommendation","I highly recommend them","I appreciate your acceptance of my connection request","I would be grateful if you could keep me in mind"],"tech":[["control card","كارت كنترول"],["power electronics","إلكترونيات القوى"],["repair lab","معمل الإصلاح"],["connection request","طلب إضافة"],["recommendation","توصية"],["networking","بناء علاقات مهنية"]],"lines":["Ahmed is 26. He repairs UPS and VFD control cards in PowerLink's repair lab in Obour.","He wants to grow in power electronics, so he decided to use LinkedIn more.","He found Eng. Tamer, a senior engineer in Munich who was born in Mansoura, like Ahmed.","He wrote: \"Hello Eng. Tamer, I came across your profile and was impressed by your background in power electronics.\"","Tamer accepted. Ahmed replied: \"I appreciate your acceptance of my connection request. I hope to learn from your posts.\"","A week later, Tamer posted an article about why IGBTs fail in drives. Ahmed commented: \"Thanks for shedding light on this topic.\"","Ahmed's old manager, Eng. Hoda, was promoted to service director. He wrote: \"Congratulations! Your hard work has paid off!\"","Then he sent her a private message: \"I was wondering if you would be willing to write me a recommendation. You know my work in the lab.\"","Hoda wrote a kind recommendation about his patience and skill.","Ahmed also wrote a post about a small company that supplies electronic parts in Cairo: \"Fast and honest. I highly recommend them.\"","One day, Tamer posted that his company would open an office in Cairo.","Ahmed wrote to him: \"If you need engineers for repairs, I would be grateful if you could keep me in mind.\"","Tamer answered with a smile emoji: \"Send me your CV. We start interviews next month.\""],"qa":[{"q":"What does Ahmed repair?","a":"UPS and VFD control cards.","opts":["Control cards","Cars"],"k":0},{"q":"Who is Eng. Tamer?","a":"A senior engineer in Munich, born in Mansoura.","opts":["Ahmed's brother","A senior engineer in Munich"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Ahmed start his message?","a":"\"I came across your profile and was impressed by your background in power electronics.\"","opts":["I was impressed by your background","Give me a job"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he say after Tamer accepted?","a":"\"I appreciate your acceptance of my connection request.\"","opts":["Why did you accept?","I appreciate your acceptance"],"k":1},{"q":"What was Tamer's article about?","a":"Why IGBTs fail in drives.","opts":["Why IGBTs fail","Football"],"k":0},{"q":"How did Ahmed comment?","a":"\"Thanks for shedding light on this topic.\"","opts":["I don't agree","Thanks for shedding light on this topic"],"k":1},{"q":"What happened to Eng. Hoda?","a":"She was promoted to service director.","opts":["She left the company","She was promoted"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Ahmed write to her?","a":"\"Your hard work has paid off!\"","opts":["Good luck next time","Your hard work has paid off"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he ask her privately?","a":"If she would be willing to write him a recommendation.","opts":["A recommendation","A loan"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he say about the parts company?","a":"\"I highly recommend them.\"","opts":["I don't recommend them","I highly recommend them"],"k":1},{"q":"What news did Tamer post?","a":"His company would open an office in Cairo.","opts":["A new Cairo office","He is retiring"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Ahmed ask Tamer?","a":"\"I would be grateful if you could keep me in mind.\"","opts":["Forget me","Keep me in mind"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Tamer answer?","a":"\"Send me your CV.\"","opts":["Send me your CV","No, thanks"],"k":0}],"pov":"Now be Ahmed networking on LinkedIn: \"I came across your profile and was impressed by your background in… Thanks for shedding light on this topic… Your hard work has paid off… would be willing to write me a recommendation… I highly recommend them… I appreciate your acceptance of my connection request… I would be grateful if you could keep me in mind.\""},"ot1":{"field":"Accounts & E-invoices","hero":"Heba","icon":"🧾","title":"A long Monday","ar":"يوم اتنين طويل","scene":"Heba is an accountant. On a busy Monday, she handles lateness, noise, gossip and a new e-invoice system — politely.","words":["I was held up in a previous meeting","Would you mind taking your call outside","Sorry to interrupt, but I have a quick question","Could you please walk me through this process one more time","I'd rather not engage in gossip","I've come down with something and need to take a sick day","Could you please hold the line for a moment"],"tech":[["e-invoice","فاتورة إلكترونية"],["tax portal","بوابة الضرايب"],["accounts department","قسم الحسابات"],["collection","تحصيل"],["cheque","شيك"],["month-end closing","قفل آخر الشهر"]],"lines":["Heba is an accountant at PowerLink in Nasr City. Mondays are always busy in the accounts department.","She arrived at the finance meeting ten minutes late. \"I apologize for being late. I was held up in a previous meeting.\"","Back at her desk, her colleague Sayed was talking loudly on the phone about his car.","\"Sayed, would you mind taking your call outside? We're closing the month today.\" He smiled and walked out.","The company had a new way to send e-invoices to the tax portal, and Heba was not sure about one step.","She went to Mr. Nabil's office. \"Sorry to interrupt, but I have a quick question.\"","He explained, but it was fast. \"Could you please walk me through this process one more time?\" she asked. He did, slowly.","At lunch, two colleagues started talking about the new sales manager's salary.","\"I'd rather not engage in gossip,\" Heba said, and changed the subject to the weather.","In the afternoon, a client called about a cheque. \"Could you please hold the line for a moment?\" She checked the file and came back with the answer.","By five o'clock she had a headache and a fever.","She texted her manager: \"I've come down with something and need to take a sick day tomorrow.\"","Her manager replied: \"Get well soon, Heba. The invoices can wait one day.\""],"qa":[{"q":"What is Heba's job?","a":"She is an accountant.","opts":["An accountant","An engineer"],"k":0},{"q":"Why was she late for the meeting?","a":"\"I was held up in a previous meeting.\"","opts":["Traffic","Held up in a previous meeting"],"k":1},{"q":"What was Sayed doing?","a":"Talking loudly on the phone about his car.","opts":["Talking loudly on the phone","Sleeping"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Heba ask him?","a":"\"Would you mind taking your call outside?\"","opts":["Talk louder","Take your call outside"],"k":1},{"q":"What was Heba not sure about?","a":"One step of sending e-invoices to the tax portal.","opts":["A step in the e-invoice system","Her salary"],"k":0},{"q":"How did she interrupt Mr. Nabil?","a":"\"Sorry to interrupt, but I have a quick question.\"","opts":["Listen to me!","Sorry to interrupt"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she ask when he explained fast?","a":"\"Could you please walk me through this process one more time?\"","opts":["Walk me through it one more time","Stop talking"],"k":0},{"q":"What were two colleagues talking about at lunch?","a":"The new sales manager's salary.","opts":["The weather","The new manager's salary"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Heba say?","a":"\"I'd rather not engage in gossip.\"","opts":["Tell me more!","I'd rather not engage in gossip"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she say to the client on the phone?","a":"\"Could you please hold the line for a moment?\"","opts":["Call back tomorrow","Hold the line for a moment"],"k":1},{"q":"How did she feel at five o'clock?","a":"She had a headache and a fever.","opts":["Great","Headache and fever"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she text her manager?","a":"\"I've come down with something and need to take a sick day.\"","opts":["She needs a raise","She needs a sick day"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Heba on a busy Monday: \"I was held up in a previous meeting… Would you mind taking your call outside… Sorry to interrupt, but I have a quick question… Could you please walk me through this process one more time… I'd rather not engage in gossip… I've come down with something and need to take a sick day… Could you please hold the line for a moment.\""},"ot2":{"field":"IT Department","hero":"Ziad","icon":"🏢","title":"The new trainee","ar":"المتدرب الجديد","scene":"Ziad is a trainee in the IT department. His first week teaches him a lot about good office manners.","words":["I'll step outside to avoid disturbing anyone","Do you have a moment to help me with this task","If you need any further assistance, please don't hesitate to ask","Let's figure out the best time","Just take it slow","Just try to be on time next time","It means to make contact or check in with someone"],"tech":[["help desk","الدعم الفني الداخلي"],["ticket","تذكرة (طلب دعم)"],["password reset","إعادة تعيين الباسورد"],["network switch","سويتش شبكة"],["laptop setup","تجهيز اللابتوب"],["backup","نسخة احتياطية"]],"lines":["Ziad is a new trainee in the IT department at PowerLink's head office in Heliopolis. His boss is Eng. Mona.","On Sunday morning, he arrived twenty minutes late because of the metro.","Mona was not angry. \"It's your first week. Just try to be on time next time.\"","Later his phone rang during a meeting. \"Excuse me, it's my mother. I'll step outside to avoid disturbing anyone.\"","In the afternoon, he had fifteen help desk tickets and did not know how to reset passwords in the new system.","He went to his colleague Hisham. \"Do you have a moment to help me with this task?\"","Hisham showed him the steps. \"Don't worry about speed. Just take it slow in the beginning.\"","\"Thanks a lot,\" Ziad said. \"If you need any further assistance, please don't hesitate to ask,\" Hisham answered.","On Tuesday, Mona wrote in an email: \"Please touch base with the warehouse about the new laptops.\"","Ziad didn't understand. \"What does 'touch base' mean?\" he asked Hisham.","\"It means to make contact or check in with someone,\" Hisham explained. \"Just call them and ask.\"","The warehouse manager was busy all day. \"Let's figure out the best time,\" Ziad said on the phone. They agreed on Thursday at ten.","On Thursday, Ziad arrived at 8:45 — the first person in the office."],"qa":[{"q":"Where does Ziad work?","a":"In the IT department at the head office in Heliopolis.","opts":["In the IT department","In the warehouse"],"k":0},{"q":"Why was he late on Sunday?","a":"Because of the metro.","opts":["He overslept","Because of the metro"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Mona tell him?","a":"\"Just try to be on time next time.\"","opts":["You're fired","Just try to be on time next time"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he say when his phone rang?","a":"\"I'll step outside to avoid disturbing anyone.\"","opts":["I'll answer here","I'll step outside"],"k":1},{"q":"How many tickets did he have?","a":"Fifteen.","opts":["Fifteen","Fifty"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he ask Hisham?","a":"\"Do you have a moment to help me with this task?\"","opts":["Can you do my job?","Do you have a moment to help me?"],"k":1},{"q":"What advice did Hisham give?","a":"\"Just take it slow in the beginning.\"","opts":["Hurry up","Just take it slow"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Hisham say about more help?","a":"\"If you need any further assistance, please don't hesitate to ask.\"","opts":["Don't ask me again","Don't hesitate to ask"],"k":1},{"q":"What didn't Ziad understand in Mona's email?","a":"The expression \"touch base\".","opts":["Touch base","Laptop"],"k":0},{"q":"What does \"touch base\" mean?","a":"\"It means to make contact or check in with someone.\"","opts":["To play baseball","To make contact or check in"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Ziad say to the busy warehouse manager?","a":"\"Let's figure out the best time.\"","opts":["Let's figure out the best time","Do it now"],"k":0},{"q":"When did they agree to meet?","a":"Thursday at ten.","opts":["Sunday at ten","Thursday at ten"],"k":1},{"q":"When did Ziad arrive on Thursday?","a":"At 8:45 — the first person in the office.","opts":["Late again","First, at 8:45"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Ziad in your first week: \"I'll step outside to avoid disturbing anyone… Do you have a moment to help me with this task… If you need any further assistance, please don't hesitate to ask… Let's figure out the best time… Just take it slow… Just try to be on time next time… It means to make contact or check in with someone.\""},"ot3":{"field":"Service Department","hero":"Walid","icon":"🧰","title":"Too many visits","ar":"زيارات كتير أوي","scene":"Walid coordinates maintenance visits. He is tired, and a colleague criticised him in front of everyone. He decides to speak calmly.","words":["My current workload feels a bit overwhelming","Can we talk about sharing the work more evenly","I've been feeling quite burned out lately","Could we find a way to free up some more room","Can we discuss ways to improve our teamwork","Would it be possible to share feedback privately in the future","I would appreciate it if we could lower our voices and discuss this issue respectfully"],"tech":[["maintenance schedule","جدول الصيانة"],["service coordinator","منسق الصيانة"],["emergency call","بلاغ طوارئ"],["spare parts store","مخزن قطع الغيار"],["field technician","فني ميداني"],["workload","ضغط الشغل"]],"lines":["Walid is a service coordinator at PowerLink. He plans maintenance visits for UPS and solar stations all over Egypt.","This summer there were too many emergency calls. He worked until nine every night.","On Sunday he went to his manager, Eng. Samir. \"My current workload feels a bit overwhelming.\"","\"I plan all the visits for Cairo and Upper Egypt, and Khaled only plans the Delta. Can we talk about sharing the work more evenly?\"","\"I've been feeling quite burned out lately,\" he added. \"I'm not sleeping well.\"","Eng. Samir listened carefully and agreed to give Upper Egypt to Khaled.","Walid had one more point. \"Also, our office is full of old UPS boxes. Could we find a way to free up some more room?\"","\"I'll ask the store to take them this week,\" Samir said.","On Tuesday, in the team meeting, Khaled said loudly, \"Walid's schedule was wrong again! My technicians went to the wrong site!\"","Everyone looked at Walid. Khaled was shouting now.","Walid stayed calm. \"I would appreciate it if we could lower our voices and discuss this issue respectfully.\"","After the meeting, he talked to Khaled alone. \"Would it be possible to share feedback privately in the future? And can we discuss ways to improve our teamwork?\"","Khaled apologised. Now they share one online schedule — and nobody goes to the wrong site."],"qa":[{"q":"What does Walid do?","a":"He plans maintenance visits.","opts":["He plans maintenance visits","He sells cars"],"k":0},{"q":"Why was he working until nine?","a":"There were too many emergency calls.","opts":["He liked it","Too many emergency calls"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he tell Eng. Samir first?","a":"\"My current workload feels a bit overwhelming.\"","opts":["My workload feels overwhelming","I want a holiday"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he ask about the work?","a":"\"Can we talk about sharing the work more evenly?\"","opts":["Doing more work","Sharing the work more evenly"],"k":1},{"q":"How has he been feeling?","a":"\"I've been feeling quite burned out lately.\"","opts":["Very happy","Burned out"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Samir decide?","a":"To give Upper Egypt to Khaled.","opts":["To fire Khaled","To give Upper Egypt to Khaled"],"k":1},{"q":"What was the problem with the office?","a":"It was full of old UPS boxes.","opts":["Old UPS boxes","No chairs"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Walid ask about the space?","a":"\"Could we find a way to free up some more room?\"","opts":["Buy more boxes","Free up some more room"],"k":1},{"q":"What happened in the team meeting?","a":"Khaled shouted that Walid's schedule was wrong.","opts":["Khaled shouted","Khaled thanked him"],"k":0},{"q":"How did Walid answer?","a":"\"I would appreciate it if we could lower our voices and discuss this issue respectfully.\"","opts":["He shouted back","He asked to lower their voices"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he ask Khaled privately?","a":"\"Would it be possible to share feedback privately in the future?\"","opts":["Share feedback privately","Never talk to me"],"k":0},{"q":"What else did he want to discuss?","a":"\"Ways to improve our teamwork.\"","opts":["Salaries","Ways to improve teamwork"],"k":1},{"q":"How do they work now?","a":"They share one online schedule.","opts":["One online schedule","Two separate schedules"],"k":0}],"pov":"Now be Walid talking to your manager and Khaled: \"My current workload feels a bit overwhelming… Can we talk about sharing the work more evenly… I've been feeling quite burned out lately… Could we find a way to free up some more room… Can we discuss ways to improve our teamwork… Would it be possible to share feedback privately in the future… I would appreciate it if we could lower our voices and discuss this issue respectfully.\""},"ot4":{"field":"Purchasing & Import","hero":"Aya","icon":"📦","title":"Juggling too many tasks","ar":"شايلة مهام كتير","scene":"Aya works in purchasing. Her role has grown a lot, but her salary hasn't. Her team leader notices she looks stressed.","words":["Is there something bothering you","I feel like I'm juggling too many tasks at once","Let's talk about which tasks we can delegate or reschedule","Those are definitely valid concerns","Can we discuss potential raises or adjustments","Can we discuss compensation for my expanded role","my salary doesn't seem to keep up with the cost of living"],"tech":[["purchasing","المشتريات"],["import","الاستيراد"],["shipment","شحنة"],["letter of credit","اعتماد مستندي"],["supplier","مورّد"],["annual review","التقييم السنوي"]],"lines":["Aya works in the purchasing department at PowerLink's office in 6th of October City.","Last year she only bought local items like cables and breakers. This year she also handles imports of batteries and inverters.","One morning, her team leader, Tamer, saw her with three phones and a pile of papers. \"Aya, is there something bothering you?\"","\"Honestly, yes. I feel like I'm juggling too many tasks at once — suppliers, shipments, letters of credit, customs.\"","\"OK. Let's talk about which tasks we can delegate or reschedule,\" Tamer said.","They decided that the new assistant, Rawan, would handle local orders, and the monthly report could move to the next week.","Aya felt better. Then she took a deep breath. \"There's another thing I'd like to discuss.\"","\"My job is much bigger now. Can we discuss compensation for my expanded role?\"","\"Also, with prices going up in Egypt, my salary doesn't seem to keep up with the cost of living.\"","Tamer nodded. \"Those are definitely valid concerns. You do the work of two people now.\"","\"Can we discuss potential raises or adjustments in the annual review?\" Aya asked.","\"I'll talk to the general manager this week,\" Tamer promised.","Three weeks later, Aya got a new title — Import Specialist — and a 20% raise."],"qa":[{"q":"Where does Aya work?","a":"In purchasing at the 6th of October office.","opts":["In purchasing","In sales"],"k":0},{"q":"What changed in her job this year?","a":"She also handles imports of batteries and inverters.","opts":["She works less","She handles imports too"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Tamer see?","a":"Aya with three phones and a pile of papers.","opts":["Three phones and papers","Aya on holiday"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he ask?","a":"\"Is there something bothering you?\"","opts":["Why are you late?","Is there something bothering you?"],"k":1},{"q":"How does Aya feel?","a":"\"I feel like I'm juggling too many tasks at once.\"","opts":["Bored","Juggling too many tasks"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Tamer suggest?","a":"\"Let's talk about which tasks we can delegate or reschedule.\"","opts":["Work at night","Delegate or reschedule tasks"],"k":1},{"q":"Who will handle local orders?","a":"The new assistant, Rawan.","opts":["Rawan","Tamer"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Aya ask about her bigger job?","a":"\"Can we discuss compensation for my expanded role?\"","opts":["A new desk","Compensation for her expanded role"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she say about her salary?","a":"\"My salary doesn't seem to keep up with the cost of living.\"","opts":["It's too high","It doesn't keep up with the cost of living"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Tamer answer?","a":"\"Those are definitely valid concerns.\"","opts":["That's not my problem","Those are valid concerns"],"k":1},{"q":"When did she want to discuss raises?","a":"In the annual review.","opts":["In the annual review","Never"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Aya get three weeks later?","a":"A new title and a 20% raise.","opts":["Nothing","A new title and a 20% raise"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Aya talking to Tamer: \"Is there something bothering you… I feel like I'm juggling too many tasks at once… Let's talk about which tasks we can delegate or reschedule… Those are definitely valid concerns… Can we discuss potential raises or adjustments… Can we discuss compensation for my expanded role… my salary doesn't seem to keep up with the cost of living.\""},"ot5":{"field":"UPS Sales","hero":"Sameh","icon":"☕","title":"Five minutes at the coffee machine","ar":"خمس دقايق عند مكنة القهوة","scene":"Sameh meets a colleague from the solar team at the coffee machine. They have a short, friendly chat before work gets busy.","words":["How's your current project going","It's quite a learning curve","I have to give credit where credit is due","Got any plans for the weekend","What's your take on","Better bring an umbrella","Sorry to cut this short, but I have a call scheduled soon"],"tech":[["hybrid inverter","إنفرتر هايبرد"],["commissioning","التشغيل التجريبي والاستلام"],["rooftop","سطح المبنى"],["site team","فريق الموقع"],["sales target","التارجت"],["weather forecast","النشرة الجوية"]],"lines":["Sameh sells UPS systems at PowerLink. Every morning he gets a coffee from the machine on the third floor.","Today he met Mariam from the solar team. \"Good morning, Mariam! How's your current project going?\"","\"It's a rooftop solar station for a hotel in Alexandria, with hybrid inverters and batteries. I've never used this inverter model before. It's quite a learning curve.\"","\"But the site team is amazing. I have to give credit where credit is due — they finished the installation a week early.\"","\"That's great! When is the commissioning?\" \"Next Thursday.\"","\"Got any plans for the weekend?\" Mariam asked.","\"I'm taking my kids to Ain Sokhna. And you?\" \"I'm going to Alexandria to visit my parents.\"","Sameh looked at his phone. \"What's your take on the new sales targets, by the way?\"","Mariam laughed. \"Ambitious — but possible if the dollar stays stable.\"","\"The forecast says rain in Alexandria this weekend,\" Sameh said. \"Better bring an umbrella.\"","\"Rain in Alex? Always!\" she said.","Then his phone buzzed. \"Sorry to cut this short, but I have a call scheduled soon with a client in Tanta.\"","\"Go, go! Good luck,\" Mariam said. Sameh walked away with his coffee — and a smile."],"qa":[{"q":"Where does Sameh get coffee?","a":"From the machine on the third floor.","opts":["From the third floor machine","From a café"],"k":0},{"q":"Whom did he meet?","a":"Mariam from the solar team.","opts":["His boss","Mariam"],"k":1},{"q":"What did he ask her?","a":"\"How's your current project going?\"","opts":["How's your current project going?","Where's my coffee?"],"k":0},{"q":"What is her project?","a":"A rooftop solar station for a hotel in Alexandria.","opts":["A school","A hotel solar station"],"k":1},{"q":"Why is it a learning curve?","a":"She has never used this inverter model before.","opts":["A new inverter model","A new boss"],"k":0},{"q":"Who did she give credit to?","a":"The site team — they finished a week early.","opts":["Herself","The site team"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Mariam ask Sameh?","a":"\"Got any plans for the weekend?\"","opts":["Got any plans for the weekend?","Did you finish the report?"],"k":0},{"q":"Where is Sameh going?","a":"To Ain Sokhna with his kids.","opts":["Alexandria","Ain Sokhna"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Sameh ask her opinion about?","a":"\"What's your take on the new sales targets?\"","opts":["The sales targets","The coffee"],"k":0},{"q":"What did he say about the rain?","a":"\"Better bring an umbrella.\"","opts":["Bring sunglasses","Better bring an umbrella"],"k":1},{"q":"Why did he end the chat?","a":"\"Sorry to cut this short, but I have a call scheduled soon.\"","opts":["He had a call","He was angry"],"k":0},{"q":"Where is his client?","a":"In Tanta.","opts":["In Aswan","In Tanta"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Sameh at the coffee machine: \"How's your current project going… It's quite a learning curve… I have to give credit where credit is due… Got any plans for the weekend… What's your take on… Better bring an umbrella… Sorry to cut this short, but I have a call scheduled soon.\""},"ot6":{"field":"Collections & Cheques","hero":"Nada","icon":"💬","title":"The first week","ar":"أول أسبوع","scene":"Nada just joined the collections team. Her colleague Islam makes her feel welcome with a friendly chat.","words":["Anything interesting lined up","I finally decided to give it a go","It depends on what you're looking for","Let's catch up again soon","Let me know if you need any help getting settled","It's been quite an adjustment","I'm sure I'll be seeing you around"],"tech":[["collections","التحصيل"],["post-dated cheque","شيك مؤجل"],["customer account","حساب العميل"],["overdue payment","دفعة متأخرة"],["bank deposit","إيداع في البنك"],["statement of account","كشف حساب"]],"lines":["Nada joined PowerLink's collections team last week. Before that, she worked at a bank in Mansoura for five years.","On Thursday, Islam from the sales team stopped by her desk. \"Hi, Nada! How's your first week?\"","\"It's been quite an adjustment,\" she said. \"New city, new company, and many post-dated cheques to follow up!\"","\"Let me know if you need any help getting settled. I know which clients always pay late,\" Islam laughed.","\"Thanks! So, the weekend is here. Anything interesting lined up?\"","\"Yes! I've wanted to learn to swim for years. I finally decided to give it a go. My first lesson is on Saturday.\"","\"Good for you! And I need a place to live near the office. Is Nasr City or New Cairo better?\"","\"It depends on what you're looking for. Nasr City is cheaper and close to the metro. New Cairo is quieter but far.\"","They talked about rent, traffic and the best koshary near the office.","Then Nada's manager called her about an overdue payment from a hospital client.","\"I have to go. Let's catch up again soon,\" Nada said.","\"Sure. We're on the same floor, so I'm sure I'll be seeing you around,\" Islam said.","Nada went back to her desk, feeling much less like a stranger."],"qa":[{"q":"Where did Nada work before?","a":"At a bank in Mansoura.","opts":["At a bank in Mansoura","At a school"],"k":0},{"q":"Which team did she join?","a":"The collections team.","opts":["Sales","Collections"],"k":1},{"q":"How is her first week?","a":"\"It's been quite an adjustment.\"","opts":["Quite an adjustment","Very boring"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Islam offer?","a":"\"Let me know if you need any help getting settled.\"","opts":["A new car","Help getting settled"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Nada ask about the weekend?","a":"\"Anything interesting lined up?\"","opts":["Anything interesting lined up?","Are you working?"],"k":0},{"q":"What is Islam going to try?","a":"Swimming. \"I finally decided to give it a go.\"","opts":["Cooking","Swimming"],"k":1},{"q":"What does Nada need?","a":"A place to live near the office.","opts":["A new job","A place to live"],"k":1},{"q":"What did Islam say about the areas?","a":"\"It depends on what you're looking for.\"","opts":["New Cairo is always better","It depends on what you're looking for"],"k":1},{"q":"Which area is cheaper?","a":"Nasr City.","opts":["Nasr City","New Cairo"],"k":0},{"q":"Why did Nada have to go?","a":"Her manager called about an overdue payment.","opts":["Lunch","An overdue payment"],"k":1},{"q":"What did she say when leaving?","a":"\"Let's catch up again soon.\"","opts":["Let's catch up again soon","Don't talk to me"],"k":0},{"q":"What did Islam answer?","a":"\"I'm sure I'll be seeing you around.\"","opts":["Goodbye forever","I'll be seeing you around"],"k":1},{"q":"How did Nada feel at the end?","a":"Much less like a stranger.","opts":["Like a stranger","Much less like a stranger"],"k":1}],"pov":"Now be Nada chatting with Islam: \"Anything interesting lined up… I finally decided to give it a go… It depends on what you're looking for… Let's catch up again soon… Let me know if you need any help getting settled… It's been quite an adjustment… I'm sure I'll be seeing you around.\""}});
Object.assign(STORY_AR,{"ng1":["محمود مدير المشتريات في «باور لينك»، شركة في مدينة نصر بتبيع أنظمة ‎UPS‎ وبطاريات.","الشهر ده كسبوا مشروع كبير: أنظمة ‎UPS‎ لاتناشر فرع بنك. ومحتاجين ألفين بطارية ‎VRLA‎ ‏12 فولت.","أستاذ وائل، وكيل مصنع بطاريات، جه مكتبه ومعاه ليستة الأسعار.","محمود بص على سعر الوحدة وهز راسه. «إحنا بندور على عرض أحسن من كده يا أستاذ وائل.»","«آسف يا محمود. ما نقدرش ننزل السعر أكتر من كده. سعر الرصاص غلي السنة دي.»","«فاهم. بس عندنا اختيارات تانية قدامنا. موردين تانيين بعتولنا عروض أسعار الأسبوع اللي فات.»","وائل سكت شوية. محمود كمّل: «تقدر تدينا أي حوافز أو تعديلات تانية؟»","«السعر هيفضل زي ما هو،» قال وائل. «بس ممكن كمان نديكم مدة سداد 90 يوم تساعدكم في السيولة.»","ده كان مهم. «باور لينك» عادةً بتدفع في تلاتين يوم، والبنك بيدفعلهم متأخر.","«حاجة كمان. ميعاد التوريد نقطة أساسية جدًا في الاتفاق ده. محتاجين البطاريات في مخزنا خلال ست أسابيع.»","وائل كلم المصنع في العاشر من رمضان. «خمس أسابيع، والتوصيل لمخزنكم ببلاش.»","محمود ابتسم. «ده عرض معقول.»","بعد الضهر، بعت أمر الشراء — والبطاريات وصلت قبل ميعادها بيوم."],"ng2":["نور مديرة حسابات عملاء في «باور لينك». أكبر عميل عندها مستشفى السلام في إسكندرية.","عقد صيانة الـ‎UPS‎ بتاعهم بيخلص الشهر الجاي، فكلمت المهندس مجدي، المدير الفني للمستشفى.","«صباح الخير يا باشمهندس مجدي. كنت حابة أتواصل مع حضرتك بخصوص تجديد العقد.»","اتقابلوا تاني يوم في مكتبه. «خلينا نحط شوية قواعد قبل ما نبدأ،» قال مجدي. «ساعة واحدة، ومن غير مفاجآت.»","«تمام جدًا،» قالت نور. «ممكن الأول نحدد البنود والشروط الأساسية للاتفاق بتاعنا؟»","كتبوها على السبورة: أربع زيارات صيانة وقائية في السنة، ومهندس متاح للطوارئ 24 ساعة، وزمن استجابة أربع ساعات.","بعدين مجدي اتكلم في الفلوس. «ميزانية المستشفى أقل السنة دي. عايزين ندفع أقل بـ15%.»","نور ما اتخضتش. «الحد اللي ما نقدرش ننزل عنه هو نفس جودة الخدمة. ما ينفعش نبعت مهندسين أقل لمستشفى.»","«فاهم،» قال مجدي. «بس فيه أي مرونة من ناحيتكم؟»","نور فكرت شوية. «ممكن نلاقي طريقة نتقابل بيها في النص في الموضوع ده؟ نقدر نخصم 7% لو مضيتوا على سنتين.»","«وقطع الغيار؟» «المراوح والفيوزات داخلين. البطاريات ليها عرض سعر لوحدها.»","«خلينا نشتغل على اتفاق يفيد الطرفين،» زودت نور. «إنتوا توفروا فلوس، وإحنا نحافظ على عميل كويس.»","مجدي ضحك وسلم عليها. «ابعتيلي العقد الجديد النهارده.»"],"ng3":["كريم مهندس مبيعات طاقة شمسية في «باور لينك». العميل بتاعه، الحاج فتحي، عنده مزرعة برتقان كبيرة جنب مدينة السادات.","المزرعة فيها عشر طلمبات ري، وفاتورة السولار مموّتاه.","كريم عرض محطة شمسية ‎400 kW‎ مع إنفرترات طلمبات شمسية بـ9 مليون جنيه.","الحاج فتحي قال: «هدفع النص دلوقتي، والباقي بعد سنة لو النتيجة كويسة.»","«بس عشان أتأكد، حضرتك تقصد إنك عايز تدفع 50% بعد سنة؟» سأل كريم.","«بالظبط. لو الطلمبات اشتغلت كويس، تاخد فلوسك.»","كريم فكر في سيولة الشركة. «إيه رأيك لو نديك ضمان أطول مقابل إنك تدفع 70% قبل التركيب؟»","«ده عرضنا، بس إحنا مستعدين نتفاوض لو عندك عرض مقابل.»","الحاج فتحي طلب 60%. كريم كلم مديره ورجع. «عشان الـ60%، إحنا مستعدين نحلّي الاتفاق بتنضيف الألواح ببلاش أول سنة.»","«وحاجة كمان. مش هقدر أأكد كفاية على أهمية الصيانة. الألواح المتربة ممكن تخسر 20% من قدرتها.»","«بناءً على خبرتنا، شايفين إن الطريقة دي هتكون الأفيد: ننضف المحطة ونكشف عليها كل شهر.»","الحاج فتحي شرب الشاي بتاعه على مهله. «عرضك يستاهل التفكير فعلًا. سيبني أكلم ولادي.»","بعد يومين، كلم كريم. «تعالى المزرعة يوم السبت — وهات العقد معاك.»"],"ng4":["دينا شغالة في الاستيراد في مكتب «باور لينك» في 6 أكتوبر. بتشتري إنفرترات ‎VFD‎ لطلمبات محطات المياه.","مورد من أوروبا بعت عرض لستين درايف ‎75 kW‎. عملت مكالمة فيديو مع مدير المبيعات عندهم، مستر باولو.","«العرض كويس،» قالت دينا، «بس لسه فيه كام حاجة محتاجة تتقفل.»","«عاجبنا الجودة والضمان بتاعكم. ومع ذلك، فيه كام نقطة حابين نتفاوض عليها.»","«أولًا، مدة التوريد ستاشر أسبوع. شركة المياه محتاجة الدرايفات قبل الصيف. للأسف ما نقدرش نقبل العرض ده بشكله الحالي.»","باولو قال: «نقدر نخليها اتناشر أسبوع، بس السعر هيزيد 4%.»","دينا ما ردتش بسرعة. «سيبني أبص على الموضوع ده بتركيز وأرجعلك.»","وسألت كمان عن تكلفة الشحن. «ممكن تديني تفاصيل أكتر عن إزاي وصلت للسعر ده؟»","باولو شرح إنه حاسب شحن جوي لجزء من الطلبية. دينا قالت إن الشحن البحري لإسكندرية كفاية.","«محتاجة أتكلم مع فريقي قبل ما آخد قرار،» قالت في آخر المكالمة.","تاني يوم كلمته تاني. «أنا مستعدة أتنازل في نقط تانية. نقدر ندفع 30% مقدم بدل 10%.»","«يبقى اتناشر أسبوع، شحن بحري، ونفس السعر،» قال باولو.","دينا قفلت اللابتوب وقالت لمديرها: «الدرايفات هتوصل قبل الصيف.»"],"ng5":["هاني مهندس مبيعات ‎IT‎ في «باور لينك». عنده اجتماع مع دكتور أشرف، مدير الـ‎IT‎ في جامعة خاصة في المنصورة.","الجامعة عايزة عشرين سيرفر راك ووحدة تخزين جديدة للداتا سنتر بتاعها.","دكتور أشرف حط تلات عروض أسعار على الترابيزة. «سعرك هو الأعلى. فيه أي طريقة تساوي العروض دي أو تنزل عنها؟»","هاني بص على العروض التانية. ما كانش فيها تركيب ولا دعم فني.","«وممكن نحتاج أربعين سيرفر السنة الجاية،» زود دكتور أشرف. «فيه أي طريقة نتفاوض على خصم كمية؟»","اتكلموا نص ساعة عن الموديلات والكابلات والتوريد. في الآخر هاني قال: «يا دكتور أشرف، ممكن ندخل في صلب الموضوع؟»","«عايز أتأكد إننا فاهمين بعض كويس. السعر هو قلقك الوحيد، ولا كمان الدعم بعد التركيب؟»","«الاتنين،» اعترف دكتور أشرف. «السنة اللي فاتت السيرفرات وقعت تلات أيام، ومحدش جه.»","«خلينا نرجع خطوة لورا ونراجع اللي اتكلمنا فيه لحد دلوقتي: عشرين سيرفر دلوقتي، يمكن أربعين السنة الجاية، ودعم سريع.»","«دلوقتي خلينا نبص على الصورة الأكبر. العروض التانية أرخص، بس هتدفع بعدين في كل زيارة.»","«إحنا عندنا تاريخ من الشراكات الناجحة مع تلات جامعات في الدلتا. ممكن تكلم مديرين الـ‎IT‎ عندهم.»","هاني عرض خصم 5% دلوقتي و10% على طلبية السنة الجاية، والدعم الفني داخل.","دكتور أشرف كلم جامعة منهم بالليل. وتاني يوم الصبح، هاني استلم أمر الشراء."],"dg1":["سلمى مهندسة صيانة في «باور لينك». بتشتغل من البيت أيام الخميس في مدينة نصر.","الساعة عشرة، بدأت مكالمة تيمز مع مستشفى في إسكندرية. واحد من إنفرترات التشيلر عندهم وقف بعطل.","ست أشخاص دخلوا: مهندسين المستشفى، وفني في الموقع، ومديرها.","بعد دقيقتين، الفيديو بتاعها هنج. «عندي شوية مشاكل في الاتصال. معلش استحملوني شوية.»","بعدين المايك بتاعها بطّل يشتغل. كتبت: «ثواني هحل المشكلة بسرعة وأرجعلكم.»","قربت من الراوتر ودخلت تاني. «آسفة على الفصل المفاجئ. رجعت دلوقتي.»","كان فيه صوت عالي في المكالمة — حد كان في ورشة فيها دوشة.","«لو سمحتم اقفلوا المايك وإنتوا مش بتتكلموا،» قالت سلمى بأدب. والدوشة وقفت.","الفني، إبراهيم، بعت صورة لشاشة الدرايف. كود العطل كان مكتوب «زيادة في الجهد».","«اتفضلوا استخدموا الشات عشان تسألوا أي سؤال،» قالت سلمى، «عشان ما نتكلمش كلنا في نفس الوقت.»","مهندسين اتنين بدأوا يتكلموا مع بعض. «معلش — خلونا نسيب اللي بيتكلم يخلص كلامه الأول،» قالت.","إبراهيم كمّل: العطل بدأ بعد انقطاع كهربا امبارح بالليل. سلمى طلبت منه يغير إعداد واحد في الدرايف.","بعد خمس دقايق، التشيلر اشتغل تاني — والنت عند سلمى كان لسه شغال."],"dg2":["مصطفى منسق مشاريع في «باور لينك». الفريق بتاعه بيبني أوضة سيرفرات لشركة أدوية في مدينة السادات.","كل يوم اتنين فيه اجتماع زووم مع العميل. النهارده بدأه في ميعاده.","«صباح الخير يا جماعة. إحنا بنسجل النهارده. استمراركم في الاجتماع معناه إنكم موافقين على التسجيل.»","بعد عشر دقايق، مدام هالة، مديرة الـ‎IT‎ عند العميل، دخلت متأخرة. «آسفة، كنت في المصنع. ممكن تديني ملخص سريع؟»","مصطفى لخّص: الـ‎UPS‎ اتركب، والراكات جاهزة، والتكييف الدقيق جاي الأسبوع الجاي.","الكل بدأ يتكلم عن ألوان الكابلات. «عشان نلحق الوقت، خلونا نتناقش في الكابلات على الإيميل،» قال مصطفى.","بعد الاجتماع، بعت لمدام هالة رسالة واتساب.","«أهلًا مدام هالة، كنت حابب أطمن مع حضرتك بخصوص وحدات التكييف.»","«للأسف، قابلتنا مشكلة مش متوقعة في الشحنة. متأخرة يومين في الميناء.»","«بس ما تقلقيش. الفريق هيشتغل يوم الجمعة، فإحنا ماشيين صح ونلحق الميعاد النهائي يوم 30.»","بعد ساعة، بعت رسالة تانية: «تذكير لطيف إن الفاتورة رقم 2245 كان ميعادها الأسبوع اللي فات. الفاتورة الإلكترونية مرفقة.»","مدام هالة ردت بإيموجي لايك. «شكرًا يا مصطفى. الحسابات هتحول الفلوس بكرة.»","مصطفى ابتسم. المشروع الكويس بيخلص في ميعاده — وبيتدفع في ميعاده."],"dg3":["ياسمين بتشتغل في «باور لينك» بقالها عشر سنين. بتصمم الكهربا والتبريد للداتا سنترات.","بس بروفايل اللينكدإن بتاعها كان فيه اسمها بس وصورة قديمة من الجامعة.","صاحبتها ريم، اللي شغالة في الـ‎HR‎، قالتلها: «مسؤولين التوظيف مش شايفين إنتي شاطرة قد إيه. يلا نكتب البايو بتاعك سوا.»","قعدوا في كافيه في الزمالك ومعاهم قهوتين ولابتوب.","ريم كتبت أول سطر: «محترفة بتركز على النتايج وعندها عشر سنين خبرة في كهربا وتبريد الداتا سنترات.»","«دلوقتي مشاريعك،» قالت ريم. ياسمين كتبت: «سجل مثبت من النجاح في تسليم داتا سنترات لبنوك ومستشفيات.»","«وإيه رأيك في الليلة اللي الـ‎UPS‎ بتاع البنك وقع فيها؟» سألت ريم. فياسمين زودت: «شاطرة في حل المشاكل المعقدة تحت الضغط.»","«وإنتي دايمًا بتساعدي المهندسين الجداد.» ياسمين كتبت: «بحب الشغل الجماعي وبستمتع بتدريب المهندسين الصغيرين.»","بعدين المستقبل: «بسعى أستفيد من خبرتي الكبيرة في الكهربا الحرجة عشان أبني داتا سنترات صديقة للبيئة في مصر.»","ياسمين كان عندها تلات شهادات جديدة، فزودت: «ملتزمة بالتعلم طول العمر.»","في جزء «نبذة عني»، كتبت عن شغلها في المبيعات: «عندي سجل مثبت في تحقيق النمو — مبيعات الداتا سنتر عندنا اتضاعفت في تلات سنين.»","غيرت صورتها القديمة ودست «حفظ».","بعد أسبوع، بقى عندها أربعين كونكشن جديد ودعوة تتكلم في مؤتمر في القاهرة."],"dg4":["أحمد عنده 26 سنة. بيصلح كروت كنترول الـ‎UPS‎ والـ‎VFD‎ في معمل الإصلاح بتاع «باور لينك» في العبور.","عايز يكبر في مجال إلكترونيات القوى، فقرر يستخدم لينكدإن أكتر.","لقى المهندس تامر، مهندس كبير في ميونخ، اتولد في المنصورة زي أحمد.","كتبله: «أهلًا باشمهندس تامر، شفت البروفايل بتاع حضرتك وانبهرت بخلفيتك في إلكترونيات القوى.»","تامر قبل الطلب. أحمد رد: «متشكر جدًا إنك قبلت طلب الإضافة. أتمنى أتعلم من بوستات حضرتك.»","بعد أسبوع، تامر نزل مقالة عن ليه الـ‎IGBT‎ بيضرب في الدرايفات. أحمد علّق: «شكرًا إنك وضحت الموضوع ده.»","مديرته القديمة، المهندسة هدى، اترقت لمديرة الصيانة. كتبلها: «مبروك! تعبك جاب نتيجة!»","بعدين بعتلها رسالة خاصة: «كنت بسأل لو حضرتك ممكن تكتبيلي توصية. إنتي عارفة شغلي في المعمل.»","هدى كتبت توصية لطيفة عن صبره ومهارته.","أحمد كمان كتب بوست عن شركة صغيرة بتوفر قطع إلكترونية في القاهرة: «سريعين وأمناء. أنصح بيهم جدًا.»","في يوم، تامر نزل بوست إن شركته هتفتح مكتب في القاهرة.","أحمد كتبله: «لو محتاجين مهندسين للإصلاح، هكون ممتن لو حضرتك تفتكرني.»","تامر رد بإيموجي ضحكة: «ابعتلي الـ‎CV‎ بتاعك. هنبدأ الإنترفيوهات الشهر الجاي.»"],"ot1":["هبة محاسبة في «باور لينك» في مدينة نصر. أيام الاتنين دايمًا زحمة في قسم الحسابات.","وصلت اجتماع المالية متأخرة عشر دقايق. «آسفة على التأخير. اتعطلت في اجتماع قبله.»","لما رجعت مكتبها، زميلها سيد كان بيتكلم في التليفون بصوت عالي عن عربيته.","«يا سيد، ممكن تكمل مكالمتك برة؟ إحنا بنقفل الشهر النهارده.» ابتسم وخرج.","الشركة كان عندها طريقة جديدة لبعت الفواتير الإلكترونية لبوابة الضرايب، وهبة ما كانتش متأكدة من خطوة.","راحت مكتب أستاذ نبيل. «آسفة إني بقاطعك، بس عندي سؤال سريع.»","شرحلها، بس كان بسرعة. «ممكن تشرحلي الخطوات دي تاني مرة كمان؟» سألته. وشرحها تاني بالراحة.","على الغدا، زميلين بدأوا يتكلموا عن مرتب مدير المبيعات الجديد.","«أنا أفضّل ما أدخلش في النميمة،» قالت هبة، وغيرت الموضوع للجو.","بعد الضهر، عميل اتصل بخصوص شيك. «ممكن تستنى على الخط لحظة؟» راجعت الملف ورجعتله بالرد.","الساعة خمسة كان عندها صداع وسخونية.","بعتت رسالة لمديرتها: «أنا تعبانة شوية ومحتاجة آخد إجازة مرضي بكرة.»","مديرتها ردت: «ألف سلامة يا هبة. الفواتير تستنى يوم.»"],"ot2":["زياد متدرب جديد في قسم الـ‎IT‎ في المكتب الرئيسي لـ«باور لينك» في مصر الجديدة. مديرته المهندسة منى.","يوم الحد الصبح، وصل متأخر عشرين دقيقة بسبب المترو.","منى ما اتعصبتش. «ده أول أسبوع ليك. بس حاول تيجي في ميعادك المرة الجاية.»","بعدين تليفونه رن في اجتماع. «بعد إذنكم، دي ماما. هخرج برة عشان ما أزعجش حد.»","بعد الضهر، كان عنده خمستاشر تذكرة دعم وما يعرفش يعمل ريسيت للباسوردات في السيستم الجديد.","راح لزميله هشام. «فاضي لحظة تساعدني في المهمة دي؟»","هشام وراه الخطوات. «ما تقلقش من السرعة. خدها على مهلك في الأول.»","«شكرًا جدًا،» قال زياد. «لو احتجت أي مساعدة تانية، ما تترددش تسأل،» رد هشام.","يوم التلات، منى كتبت في إيميل: «من فضلك اعمل ‎touch base‎ مع المخزن بخصوص اللابتوبات الجديدة.»","زياد ما فهمش. «يعني إيه ‎touch base‎؟» سأل هشام.","«يعني تتواصل مع حد أو تطمن معاه على حاجة،» شرح هشام. «كلمهم واسألهم وخلاص.»","مدير المخزن كان مشغول طول اليوم. «خلينا نشوف أنسب وقت،» قال زياد في التليفون. واتفقوا على الخميس الساعة عشرة.","يوم الخميس، زياد وصل الساعة تسعة إلا ربع — أول واحد في المكتب."],"ot3":["وليد منسق صيانة في «باور لينك». بيخطط زيارات الصيانة لأنظمة الـ‎UPS‎ والمحطات الشمسية في كل حتة في مصر.","الصيف ده كان فيه بلاغات طوارئ كتير أوي. كان بيشتغل لحد الساعة تسعة كل يوم.","يوم الحد راح لمديره، المهندس سمير. «ضغط الشغل اللي عليا دلوقتي كتير شوية.»","«أنا بخطط كل الزيارات للقاهرة والصعيد، وخالد بيخطط الدلتا بس. ممكن نتكلم إزاي نقسم الشغل بالعدل أكتر؟»","«بقالي فترة حاسس إني مستنزف خالص،» زود. «مش بنام كويس.»","المهندس سمير سمعه كويس ووافق يدي الصعيد لخالد.","وليد كان عنده نقطة كمان. «وكمان المكتب مليان كراتين ‎UPS‎ قديمة. ممكن نلاقي طريقة نفضي مساحة أكتر؟»","«هطلب من المخزن ياخدها الأسبوع ده،» قال سمير.","يوم التلات، في اجتماع الفريق، خالد قال بصوت عالي: «جدول وليد غلط تاني! الفنيين بتوعي راحوا الموقع الغلط!»","الكل بص لوليد. خالد كان بيزعق دلوقتي.","وليد فضل هادي. «هبقى ممنون لو وطّينا صوتنا واتكلمنا في الموضوع ده باحترام.»","بعد الاجتماع، اتكلم مع خالد لوحدهم. «ممكن بعد كده تقولي ملاحظاتك على انفراد؟ وممكن نتكلم إزاي نحسّن شغلنا مع بعض؟»","خالد اعتذر. دلوقتي بيستخدموا جدول أونلاين واحد — ومحدش بيروح الموقع الغلط."],"ot4":["آية شغالة في قسم المشتريات في مكتب «باور لينك» في 6 أكتوبر.","السنة اللي فاتت كانت بتشتري حاجات محلية بس زي الكابلات والبريكرات. السنة دي كمان مسؤولة عن استيراد البطاريات والإنفرترات.","في يوم الصبح، التيم ليدر بتاعها، تامر، شافها ماسكة تلات تليفونات وقدامها كوم ورق. «يا آية، فيه حاجة مضايقاكي؟»","«بصراحة آه. حاسة إني شايلة مهام كتير أوي في نفس الوقت — موردين، وشحنات، واعتمادات مستندية، وجمارك.»","«ماشي. خلينا نتكلم إيه المهام اللي ممكن نديها لحد تاني أو نأجلها،» قال تامر.","قرروا إن المساعدة الجديدة، روان، تمسك الطلبيات المحلية، والتقرير الشهري يتأجل للأسبوع اللي بعده.","آية ارتاحت. بعدين خدت نفس عميق. «فيه حاجة تانية حابة أتكلم فيها.»","«شغلي بقى أكبر بكتير دلوقتي. ممكن نتكلم عن مقابل لدوري اللي كبر؟»","«وكمان، مع غلو الأسعار في مصر، مرتبي مش ملاحق على تكاليف المعيشة.»","تامر هز راسه. «دي مخاوف في محلها فعلًا. إنتي بتعملي شغل اتنين دلوقتي.»","«ممكن نتكلم عن زيادة أو تعديل في التقييم السنوي؟» سألت آية.","«هكلم المدير العام الأسبوع ده،» وعدها تامر.","بعد تلات أسابيع، آية خدت مسمى وظيفي جديد — أخصائية استيراد — وزيادة 20%."],"ot5":["سامح بيبيع أنظمة ‎UPS‎ في «باور لينك». كل يوم الصبح بياخد قهوة من المكنة اللي في الدور التالت.","النهارده قابل مريم من فريق الطاقة الشمسية. «صباح الخير يا مريم! مشروعك الحالي عامل إيه؟»","«محطة شمسية على سطح فندق في إسكندرية، بإنفرترات هايبرد وبطاريات. عمري ما استخدمت موديل الإنفرتر ده قبل كده. بتعلم حاجات كتير جديدة.»","«بس فريق الموقع تحفة. لازم أدي كل واحد حقه — خلصوا التركيب قبل الميعاد بأسبوع.»","«حلو جدًا! والتشغيل والاستلام إمتى؟» «الخميس الجاي.»","«عندك أي خطط للويك إند؟» سألت مريم.","«واخد العيال العين السخنة. وإنتي؟» «رايحة إسكندرية أزور أهلي.»","سامح بص في موبايله. «صحيح، إيه رأيك في التارجت الجديد بتاع المبيعات؟»","مريم ضحكت. «طموح — بس ممكن لو الدولار فضل ثابت.»","«النشرة بتقول فيه مطر في إسكندرية الويك إند ده،» قال سامح. «الأحسن تاخدي شمسية.»","«مطر في إسكندرية؟ على طول!» قالت.","بعدين موبايله رن. «آسف إني هقطع الكلام، بس عندي مكالمة قريب مع عميل في طنطا.»","«روح، روح! بالتوفيق،» قالت مريم. وسامح مشي بالقهوة بتاعته — وابتسامة."],"ot6":["ندى انضمت لفريق التحصيل في «باور لينك» الأسبوع اللي فات. قبل كده كانت شغالة في بنك في المنصورة خمس سنين.","يوم الخميس، إسلام من فريق المبيعات عدى على مكتبها. «أهلًا يا ندى! أول أسبوع عامل إيه؟»","«محتاج تعوّد كبير،» قالت. «مدينة جديدة، وشركة جديدة، وشيكات مؤجلة كتير لازم أتابعها!»","«لو احتجتي أي مساعدة عشان تستقري، قوليلي. أنا عارف مين من العملا دايمًا بيدفع متأخر،» ضحك إسلام.","«شكرًا! طيب، الويك إند جه. عندك حاجة حلوة مترتبة؟»","«آه! بقالي سنين نفسي أتعلم عوم. وأخيرًا قررت أجرب. أول درس يوم السبت.»","«برافو عليكي! وأنا محتاجة مكان أسكن فيه قريب من الشغل. مدينة نصر أحسن ولا القاهرة الجديدة؟»","«على حسب إنتي بتدوري على إيه. مدينة نصر أرخص وقريبة من المترو. القاهرة الجديدة أهدى بس بعيدة.»","اتكلموا عن الإيجارات والزحمة وأحسن كشري جنب الشغل.","بعدين مديرة ندى كلمتها بخصوص دفعة متأخرة من عميل مستشفى.","«لازم أمشي. نبقى نتكلم تاني قريب،» قالت ندى.","«أكيد. إحنا في نفس الدور، فأكيد هنشوف بعض كتير،» قال إسلام.","ندى رجعت مكتبها، وهي حاسة إنها بقت أقل غربة بكتير."]});
